      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[5].images.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[10].images.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[11].images.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[12].images.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[4].lines.Array.data[0]
      value: 'Man, this place is a safety hazard without the lights on! '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[4].lines.Array.data[1]
      value: Just be careful not to trip into any sand traps, ok? The nearest hospital
        is almost 30 strokes away!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[4].names.Array.data[1]
      value: I. Ron
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[5].lines.Array.data[0]
      value: 'Good job getting to the final level! '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[5].lines.Array.data[1]
      value: If my memory serves, this windmill holds the dynamo that supplies all
        the power to the golf course!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[5].lines.Array.data[2]
      value: 'I think corporate installed the emergency power switch inside the hole,
        just past the windmill. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[5].lines.Array.data[3]
      value: "If you\u2019re quick, my supervisor might not get all rough with me
        about the power. Good luck and happy putting!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[5].names.Array.data[2]
      value: I. Ron
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[5].names.Array.data[3]
      value: I. Ron
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[10].lines.Array.data[0]
      value: You navigated that with the confidence of a Driver!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[10].lines.Array.data[1]
      value: "Keep it up and you\u2019ll be acing levels in no time! "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[11].lines.Array.data[0]
      value: 'Thanks for the help! All the lights should be back on! '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[11].lines.Array.data[1]
      value: "We built the windmill to get out of a power contract with Putts\u2122
        Energy."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[11].lines.Array.data[2]
      value: 'They used to upcharge us 20 bucks for each swing above par! '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[11].lines.Array.data[3]
      value: "Alright, let\u2019s move on to the next world!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[11].lines.Array.data[4]
      value: I hope you're ready for a vacation!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[11].names.Array.data[2]
      value: I. Ron
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[11].names.Array.data[3]
      value: I. Ron
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[11].names.Array.data[4]
      value: I. Ron
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[12].lines.Array.data[0]
      value: "CORPORATE would like me to extend you an official congratulations from
        all of us here at Golf\u2019d Inc for making it to your first hole of the
        day! "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[12].lines.Array.data[1]
      value: 'Wait a minute the hole is not here, is it?  '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[12].lines.Array.data[2]
      value: "Try moving your phone--sorry--DIGITAL PUTTER\u2122 around to get a
        good look at the ground. If done properly, CORPORATE tells me you should
        see a grid of dots appear. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[12].lines.Array.data[3]
      value: "After seeing the grid of dots, you will need to tap anywhere on that
        grid to place your level and once your level is placed, pressing and holding
        the screen of your DIGITAL PUTTER\u2122 will make your club appear.  "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[4].images.Array.data[1]
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cc5df9a9b52d18d4dbcb7d8bc3e5549c,
